Voxpod

This image bundles third-party models and code that stay on disk after the
image is built:

- LuxTTS (YatharthS/LuxTTS), Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/ysharma3501/LuxTTS
- LinaCodec, pulled in by LuxTTS
- openai/whisper-tiny, used only to transcribe a voice sample on this machine
  https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-tiny
- libsndfile 1.2.2, built in the image for wav files, GNU LGPL 2.1
  https://github.com/libsndfile/libsndfile
- ffmpeg, a static build by John Van Sickle, used to convert recordings to wav.
  That build is GNU GPL. https://johnvansickle.com/ffmpeg/
